 enough for you to migrate to some other place?’ These people will have Hell as their refuge, an evil destination,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"4:97"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those whom ","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"4:97"},{"pos":3,"ar":"تَوَفَّىٰهُمُ","en_gloss":"take them (in death)","transliteration":"tawaffāhumu","verse_key":"4:97"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ","en_gloss":"the Angels","transliteration":"l-malāikatu","verse_key":"4:97"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ظَالِمِىٓ","en_gloss":"(while) they (were) wronging","transliteration":"ẓālimī","verse_key":"4:97"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَنفُسِهِمْ","en_gloss":"themselves","transliteration":"anfusihim","verse_key":"4:97"},{"pos":7,"ar":"قَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"they say","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"4:97"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فِيمَ","en_gloss":"In what (condition)","transliteration":"fīma","verse_key":"4:97"},{"pos":9,"ar":"كُنتُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"were you","transliteration":"kuntum","verse_key":"4:97"},{"pos":10,"ar":"قَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"They said","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"4:97"},{"pos":11,"ar":"كُنَّا","en_gloss":"We were","transliteration":"kunnā","verse_key":"4:97"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مُسْتَضْعَفِينَ","en_gloss":"oppressed","transliteration":"mus'taḍʿafīna","verse_key":"4:97"},{"pos":13,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"4:97"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"4:97"},{"pos":15,"ar":"قَالُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"They said","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"4:97"},{"pos":16,"ar":"أَلَمْ","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"alam","verse_key":"4:97"},{"pos":17,"ar":"تَكُنْ","en_gloss":"was","transliteration":"takun","verse_key":"4:97"},{"pos":18,"ar":"أَرْضُ","en_gloss":"(the) earth","transliteration":"arḍu","verse_key":"4:97"},{"pos":19,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"4:97"},{"pos":20,"ar":"وَٰسِعَةًۭ